title: an illustration
pid: 83e9fc1b-bb97-4dd2-87f6-2d8bc0c8535f
body: |2-
  For example, the concept "love" might present some ideas and some stories. All of them (concepts, ideas, stories, probably other kinds) are atoms. The atom "humility" might present some atoms, and they might overlap with the atoms presented by "love".
